# Only what the image is built from goes to the builder: pyproject.toml, the four documents
# the wheel carries, src/ and examples/, and the two guides the agent's server offers.
# Everything else stays out, the user's own files first.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!DISCLAIMER.md
!THIRD_PARTY.md
!src
!examples
!docs/GUIDE.md
!docs/MCP.md

# Inside what is let in: what Python leaves behind, and the hosted page's Python runtime,
# which the installed engine never loads.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
src/motionsim/webui/engine/pyodide
